			<h1>Hi, I'm Teron Johnson.</h1>
			<p>I'm a computer science student at the University of Cincinnati and I'm focused on full-stack dev and game design/development.</p>

			<section id="projects">
				<h2>Featured Work</h2>
				<div style="padding-bottom: 100px;">
				</div>
				
