					<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Coding project thumbnail" class="card-image" />

					<div class="card-content">
						<a href="/personalportfolio">
						<h3>Personal Portfolio Website</h3>
						<p>Built a protfolio website from scratch using HTML, CSS, and Astro.</p>
