							<span>HTML,</span>
							<span>CSS,</span>
							<span>Astro</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Project 2 -->
				<div class="project-card">
					<img src="/public/university-of-construction-thumbnail.png" alt="Game project thumbnail" class="card-image" />

					<div class="card-content">
						<a href="/universityofconstruction">
						<h3>2D Unity Platformer</h3>
						<p>Developed a 2D platforming game implementing custom physics controllers, state machines, and integrated custom visual assets.</p>
						<div class="teck-stack">
							<span>C#,</span>
							<span>Unity</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
